parameters.text:
=Analyze the following incoming lead.

Preserve all original lead information exactly as instructed.

Lead:

Name: {{ $json.name }}
Email: {{ $json.Email }}
Company: {{ $json.Company }}
Website: {{ $json.Website }}
Industry: {{ $json.Industry }}
Service: {{ $json.Service }}
Budget: {{ $json.Budget }}
Message: {{ $json.Message }}

Qualify this lead and return the complete JSON object according to your system instructions.

parameters.jsCode:
const rawOutput = $json.output;

// AI output ko JSON object mein convert karo
const lead = typeof rawOutput === 'string'
  ? JSON.parse(rawOutput)
  : rawOutput;

// Clean structured output return karo
return {
  json: {
    name: lead.name || "",
    email: lead.email || "",
    company: lead.company || "",
    website: lead.website || "",
    industry: lead.industry || "",
    service: lead.service || "",
    budget: lead.budget || "",
    message: lead.message || "",

    lead_score: Number(lead.lead_score) || 0,
    priority: lead.priority || "COLD",
    intent: lead.intent || "LOW",
    reason: lead.reason || "",
    recommended_action: lead.recommended_action || ""
  }
};

